{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HistoryState"},{"type":"text","value":" interface is an interface exported by the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"history"},{"type":"text","value":" package that describes the shape of the state object that can be used in conjunction with the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"history"},{"type":"text","value":" package and the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"window.location"},{"type":"text","value":" API."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can extend this interface to add additional properties to the state object across your application."}]},{"type":"code","value":"// src/main.tsx\ndeclare module '@tanstack/react-router' {\n  // ...\n\n  interface HistoryState {\n    additionalRequiredProperty: number\n    additionalProperty?: string\n  }\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `HistoryState` interface is an interface exported by the `history` package that describes the shape of the state object that can be used in conjunction with the `history` package and the `window.location` API.\n\nYou can extend this interface to add additional properties to the state object across your application.\n\n```tsx\n// src/main.tsx\ndeclare module '@tanstack/react-router' {\n  // ...\n\n  interface HistoryState {\n    additionalRequiredProperty: number\n    additionalProperty?: string\n  }\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: historyStateInterface\ntitle: HistoryState interface\n---\n\nThe `HistoryState` interface is an interface exported by the `history` package that describes the shape of the state object that can be used in conjunction with the `history` package and the `window.location` API.\n\nYou can extend this interface to add additional properties to the state object across your application.\n\n```tsx\n// src/main.tsx\ndeclare module '@tanstack/react-router' {\n  // ...\n\n  interface HistoryState {\n    additionalRequiredProperty: number\n    additionalProperty?: string\n  }\n}\n```\n"}
